  "detail_text": "Please read the Sources Sought in its entirety. This is a Sources Sought Notice requesting capable vendors to provide a Temporary Abrasive Blast System in accordance with the Statement of Work. Please make sure to respond prior to 3/25/2026 @ 12:00 PM EST. This is not a solicitation and no pricing information is necessary. Please complete the questions below and send your response via email to David Ham, david.m.ham7.civ@us.navy.mil. Capable vendors are encouraged to submit the following information: Company Name: Address: POC: CAGE: Confirmation of Small Business under NAICS 532490: Anticipated Mobolization Time: Can you provide equipment fully compliant with the SOW: Attachments include: Statement of Work & Compliance Checklist",
